<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Piper starts two footwear stocks.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Piper starts two footwear stocks.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Piper Jaffray said analyst Brent Rystrom initiated coverage of two companies involved in retailing athletic footwear and apparel.</p>
<p>-- The analyst started Footstar Inc and Finish Line Inc with buys.</p>
<p>-- Footstart rose 3/8 to 20-3/4 and Finish Line rose one to 11-1/8.</p>
</text>
